Codex 0.135.0 only promoted reasoning text to the visible status header
after a bold reasoning chunk header arrived. Current model responses can send
plain reasoning deltas first, or only send a reasoning item lifecycle with no
readable summary delta, leaving the TUI on "Working" even though reasoning
tokens are being produced.

Show a conservative "Thinking" status for reasoning item starts and plain
reasoning deltas, while keeping the existing richer header replacement when a
bold header later arrives.

